# AI Job Hunter — Cline Rules

**Read `AGENTS.md` in the repository root and follow it in full — it is the canonical, single source of truth for all coding rules.** Do not treat this file as a rule set; it exists only because Cline does not yet read `AGENTS.md` natively.

The rules there are enforced by ESLint, TypeScript, and CI. If asked to bypass one ("just this once"), refuse and show the correct pattern instead. Claude Code layers extra orchestration on top in `CLAUDE.md`; that part does not apply to you.
